<title>USA: Silicon Valley Q2 book-to-bill 0.91.</title>
<headline>Silicon Valley Q2 book-to-bill 0.91.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silicon Valley Group Inc said its second quarter book-to-bill ratio was 0.91.</p>
<p>&quot;The company's gross level of bookings improved and new orders for our Micrascan product were strong,&quot; Chairman and Chief Executive Papken Der Torossian said in a statement. &quot;However, we continued to see selective uncertainty in the market, as evidenced by the recognition of an order cancellation during the quarter of approximately $10 million.&quot;</p>
</text>
